         The broken edge is muted and dashed, never oxide. Oxide on this site
         means a decision that was taken back, and a pointer that does not
         fire is a cost the trade was bought with. The .lab-topo comment on
         netops-lab records the same rule. The unread body is dashed rather
         than absent, because the file exists: nothing read it.

         No digit (ADR-013). Every state is a word plus a shape.

